{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"纬悬"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"纬悬"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 "},{"Local":{"url":"无穷范畴","text":"$\\infty$-范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ 有"},{"Local":{"url":"终对象","text":"终对象"}},{"Plain":" $*$. 定义对象 $X$ 的<strong>纬悬</strong> $\\Sigma X$ 为如下推出,\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n    {ccc}\r\n    X &amp; \\to &amp; * \\\\\r\n    \\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow \\\\\r\n    * &amp; \\to &amp; \\Sigma X.\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>纬悬函子 $\\Sigma\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C_{*/}$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"环路空间","text":"环路空间"}},{"Plain":"函子 $\\Omega\\colon \\mathcal C_{*/} \\to \\mathcal C$ 的左"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随","text":"伴随"}},{"Plain":": 对任意对象 $X$ 以及"},{"Local":{"url":"带基点对象","text":"带基点对象"}},{"Plain":" $Y$, 交换图\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n    {ccc}\r\n    X &amp; \\to &amp; *\\\\\r\n    \\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow\\\\\r\n    * &amp; \\to &amp; Y\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n等同于态射 $\\Sigma X\\to Y$, 也等同于态射 $X\\to\\Omega Y$.</p>\n"}]}}